    {
      "text": "Combine room temperature sausage, biscuit mix, and shredded Cheddar together in a large bowl; mix with your hands until well combined. The mixture may seem dry at first, but keep mixing until it comes together evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1qP3IKK8B1cGFkBriBpQWGEMd_s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-RM-21649-sausage-balls-ddmfs-step3-3x4-ad2b29c768734d5bb0085700f6a6f19c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21649/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll mixture into about 30 walnut-sized balls; transfer to a baking sheet.",
